(:room
 :id "camp"
 :title "Dunge Crawler Testbed"
 :body
 ((:p "A low campfire burns at the edge of the white arch. This is a tiny adaptation slice: authored rooms hand off to a generated dungeon graph prepared by Common Lisp.")
  (:p "The test delver has a lantern, two rations, and just enough nerve to step through.")
  (:choice "Approach the white arch" (:go "threshold"))
  (:choice "Leave the testbed" (:quit))))
